<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Boumat interim shr rises, no div.</title>
<headline>Boumat interim shr rises, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	 25.0	vs    17.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     8.98	vs    5.89</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    13.93	vs    12.14</p>
<p>    Tax			   4.91	vs    6.25</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    17.91	vs    11.81</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,082.96	vs    994.56</p>
<p>Full name: Boumat Ltd (building and construction)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said due to the high level of debt divident would not be declared. It said trading conditions were likely to remain tight during the year and current trends were expected to prevail.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
